# 🔊 Text-to-Voice Application

A simple and interactive web application that converts written text into natural-sounding speech using the Web Speech Synthesis API. Users can enter text, choose a voice (if supported), and listen to the spoken output directly in the browser.

## 🚀 Features

- 📝 Convert text into speech instantly
- 🔊 High-quality speech synthesis
- 🌐 Browser-based application (no installation required)
- 🎨 Clean and responsive user interface
- ⚡ Fast and easy to use
- 📱 Works on desktop and mobile browsers (where supported)

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Web Speech Synthesis API

## 📂 Project Structure

```
Text-to-Voice/
│── index.html
│── style.css
│── script.js
└── README.md
```

## ▶️ How to Run

1. Clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in a supported web browser.
4. Enter the text you want to hear.
5. Click the **Speak** button to listen to the generated speech.

